Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's a token of my friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.04,0:00:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They said I had this when I came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.96,0:00:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.56,0:00:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's important to you, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.40,0:00:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You can give me something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.32,0:00:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it, Hugo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.16,0:00:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're giving me your most treasured possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.92,0:00:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.92,0:00:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take good care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.64,0:00:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll always be friends, Mano.
